{"seq":3,"slug":"inspections-quickfix","title":"检查与快速修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin/inspections-quickfix","wordCount":877,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"检查与快速修复\">检查与快速修复</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Inspection（检查）和 QuickFix（快速修复）是 IntelliJ Platform 代码质量保障的核心机制。Inspection 负责发现代码中的潜在问题，QuickFix 提供一键修复方案。两者协同工作，构成了 IDE 实时代码分析的基础。</p>\n<p>IntelliJ 的 Inspection 系统与 ESLint 的 Rule 概念类似，但运行在更深层的语义模型上。ESLint 基于 AST 模式匹配，而 IntelliJ Inspection 基于 PSI 树的完整语义信息，可以进行类型推断、控制流分析和跨文件引用检查。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[源代码变更] --&gt; B[PSI 树更新]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Inspection Manager]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Local Inspection]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Global Inspection]&#10;    D --&gt; F[文件内分析]&#10;    E --&gt; G[跨文件分析]&#10;    F --&gt; H{发现问题?}&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[注册 ProblemDescriptor]&#10;    I --&gt; J[编辑器高亮显示]&#10;    J --&gt; K[QuickFix 建议]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| L[通过检查]\">graph TD\n    A[源代码变更] --&gt; B[PSI 树更新]\n    B --&gt; C[Inspection Manager]\n    C --&gt; D[Local Inspection]\n    C --&gt; E[Global Inspection]\n    D --&gt; F[文件内分析]\n    E --&gt; G[跨文件分析]\n    F --&gt; H{发现问题?}\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt;|是| I[注册 ProblemDescriptor]\n    I --&gt; J[编辑器高亮显示]\n    J --&gt; K[QuickFix 建议]\n    H --&gt;|否| L[通过检查]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Local Inspection</th>\n<th>Global Inspection</th>\n<th>External Annotator</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分析范围</td>\n<td>单文件</td>\n<td>全项目</td>\n<td>单文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发时机</td>\n<td>编辑时实时</td>\n<td>手动运行或批量</td>\n<td>编辑时异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能影响</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（后台线程）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>语法/语义错误</td>\n<td>未使用声明、依赖分析</td>\n<td>外部工具集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 基类</td>\n<td><code>LocalInspectionTool</code></td>\n<td><code>GlobalInspectionTool</code></td>\n<td><code>ExternalAnnotator</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果展示</td>\n<td>编辑器内高亮</td>\n<td>Inspection 结果面板</td>\n<td>编辑器内高亮</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"localinspectiontool-实现\">LocalInspectionTool 实现</h2><p><code>LocalInspectionTool</code> 是最常用的 Inspection 类型，在用户编辑代码时实时运行。它通过 Visitor 模式遍历当前文件的 PSI 树，发现问题后注册 <code>ProblemDescriptor</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class EmptyCatchBlockInspection : AbstractBaseJavaLocalInspectionTool() {&#10;&#10;    override fun buildVisitor(&#10;        holder: ProblemsHolder,&#10;        isOnTheFly: Boolean&#10;    ): PsiElementVisitor {&#10;        return object : JavaElementVisitor() {&#10;            override fun visitCatchSection(section: PsiCatchSection) {&#10;                super.visitCatchSection(section)&#10;                val catchBlock = section.catchBlock ?: return&#10;                val statements = catchBlock.statements&#10;&#10;                if (statements.isEmpty()) {&#10;                    holder.registerProblem(&#10;                        section.firstChild,&#10;                        &quot;空的 catch 块会吞掉异常，可能导致难以排查的问题&quot;,&#10;                        ProblemHighlightType.WARNING,&#10;                        AddLoggingQuickFix(),&#10;                        RethrowExceptionQuickFix()&#10;                    )&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class EmptyCatchBlockInspection : AbstractBaseJavaLocalInspectionTool() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun buildVisitor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        holder: ProblemsHolder,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        isOnTheFly: Boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): PsiElementVisitor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return object : JavaElementVisitor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun visitCatchSection(section: PsiCatchSection) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                super.visitCatchSection(section)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val catchBlock = section.catchBlock ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val statements = catchBlock.statements</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (statements.isEmpty()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    holder.registerProblem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        section.firstChild,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        \"空的 catch 块会吞掉异常，可能导致难以排查的问题\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        ProblemHighlightType.WARNING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        AddLoggingQuickFix(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        RethrowExceptionQuickFix()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ProblemsHolder</code> 是问题收集器，<code>registerProblem()</code> 接受以下参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"holder.registerProblem(&#10;    element,         // 标记问题的 PSI 元素&#10;    description,     // 问题描述文本&#10;    highlightType,   // 高亮类型（ERROR/WARNING/WEAK_WARNING/INFORMATION）&#10;    *fixes           // 一个或多个 QuickFix&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>holder.registerProblem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    element,         // 标记问题的 PSI 元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    description,     // 问题描述文本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    highlightType,   // 高亮类型（ERROR/WARNING/WEAK_WARNING/INFORMATION）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    *fixes           // 一个或多个 QuickFix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Inspection 需要在 <code>plugin.xml</code> 中注册：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;extensions defaultExtensionNs=&quot;com.intellij&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;localInspection&#10;        language=&quot;JAVA&quot;&#10;        shortName=&quot;EmptyCatchBlock&quot;&#10;        displayName=&quot;Empty catch block&quot;&#10;        groupPath=&quot;Java,Error handling&quot;&#10;        groupName=&quot;Probable bugs&quot;&#10;        enabledByDefault=&quot;true&quot;&#10;        level=&quot;WARNING&quot;&#10;        implementationClass=&quot;com.example.EmptyCatchBlockInspection&quot;/&gt;&#10;&lt;/extensions&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">extensions</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defaultExtensionNs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.intellij\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">localInspection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        language</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JAVA\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        shortName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EmptyCatchBlock\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        displayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Empty catch block\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        groupPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Java,Error handling\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        groupName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Probable bugs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        enabledByDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"WARNING\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        implementationClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.EmptyCatchBlockInspection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">extensions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>groupPath</code> 定义了 Inspection 在设置面板中的分类路径，<code>enabledByDefault</code> 控制是否默认启用，<code>level</code> 指定默认严重级别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"quickfix-开发模式\">QuickFix 开发模式</h2><p>QuickFix 继承自 <code>LocalQuickFix</code> 接口，在 <code>applyFix()</code> 方法中执行代码修改。一个好的 QuickFix 应该是<strong>幂等的</strong>、<strong>安全的</strong>，并且提供清晰的描述。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class AddLoggingQuickFix : LocalQuickFix {&#10;&#10;    override fun getFamilyName(): String = &quot;添加日志记录&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun applyFix(project: Project, descriptor: ProblemDescriptor) {&#10;        val catchSection = descriptor.psiElement.parent as? PsiCatchSection ?: return&#10;        val catchBlock = catchSection.catchBlock ?: return&#10;        val parameter = catchSection.parameter ?: return&#10;        val paramName = parameter.name&#10;&#10;        val factory = JavaPsiFacade.getElementFactory(project)&#10;        val logStatement = factory.createStatementFromText(&#10;            &quot;java.util.logging.Logger.getLogger(getClass().getName()).log(&quot; +&#10;                &quot;java.util.logging.Level.SEVERE, \\&quot;Caught exception\\&quot;, $paramName);&quot;,&#10;            catchBlock&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {&#10;            catchBlock.add(logStatement)&#10;            JavaCodeStyleManager.getInstance(project)&#10;                .shortenClassReferences(catchBlock)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class RethrowExceptionQuickFix : LocalQuickFix {&#10;&#10;    override fun getFamilyName(): String = &quot;重新抛出异常&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun applyFix(project: Project, descriptor: ProblemDescriptor) {&#10;        val catchSection = descriptor.psiElement.parent as? PsiCatchSection ?: return&#10;        val catchBlock = catchSection.catchBlock ?: return&#10;        val parameter = catchSection.parameter ?: return&#10;&#10;        val factory = JavaPsiFacade.getElementFactory(project)&#10;        val throwStatement = factory.createStatementFromText(&#10;            &quot;throw new RuntimeException(${parameter.name});&quot;,&#10;            catchBlock&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {&#10;            catchBlock.add(throwStatement)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class AddLoggingQuickFix : LocalQuickFix {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getFamilyName(): String = \"添加日志记录\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun applyFix(project: Project, descriptor: ProblemDescriptor) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val catchSection = descriptor.psiElement.parent as? PsiCatchSection ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val catchBlock = catchSection.catchBlock ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val parameter = catchSection.parameter ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val paramName = parameter.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val factory = JavaPsiFacade.getElementFactory(project)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val logStatement = factory.createStatementFromText(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"java.util.logging.Logger.getLogger(getClass().getName()).log(\" +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"java.util.logging.Level.SEVERE, \\\"Caught exception\\\", $paramName);\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            catchBlock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            catchBlock.add(logStatement)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            JavaCodeStyleManager.getInstance(project)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .shortenClassReferences(catchBlock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class RethrowExceptionQuickFix : LocalQuickFix {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getFamilyName(): String = \"重新抛出异常\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun applyFix(project: Project, descriptor: ProblemDescriptor) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val catchSection = descriptor.psiElement.parent as? PsiCatchSection ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val catchBlock = catchSection.catchBlock ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val parameter = catchSection.parameter ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val factory = JavaPsiFacade.getElementFactory(project)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val throwStatement = factory.createStatementFromText(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"throw new RuntimeException(${parameter.name});\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            catchBlock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            catchBlock.add(throwStatement)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>getFamilyName()</code> 返回的文本显示在 Alt+Enter 意图列表中。当多个 QuickFix 注册在同一问题上时，用户可以选择最适合的修复方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant I as Inspection&#10;    participant Q as QuickFix&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: 编辑代码&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;I: 触发增量分析&#10;    I-&gt;&gt;I: buildVisitor 遍历 PSI&#10;    I-&gt;&gt;E: registerProblem + QuickFix&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;U: 显示黄色警告波浪线&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: Alt+Enter&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;U: 显示修复选项列表&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;Q: 选择修复方案&#10;    Q-&gt;&gt;Q: applyFix 修改 PSI&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;U: 代码已修复\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant I as Inspection\n    participant Q as QuickFix\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: 编辑代码\n    E-&gt;&gt;I: 触发增量分析\n    I-&gt;&gt;I: buildVisitor 遍历 PSI\n    I-&gt;&gt;E: registerProblem + QuickFix\n    E-&gt;&gt;U: 显示黄色警告波浪线\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: Alt+Enter\n    E-&gt;&gt;U: 显示修复选项列表\n    U-&gt;&gt;Q: 选择修复方案\n    Q-&gt;&gt;Q: applyFix 修改 PSI\n    E-&gt;&gt;U: 代码已修复</pre><p>高级 QuickFix 还可以使用 <strong>预览模式</strong>，在应用前显示修改的差异对比：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MyQuickFix : LocalQuickFix {&#10;    override fun getFamilyName(): String = &quot;我的修复&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun generatePreview(&#10;        project: Project,&#10;        previewDescriptor: ProblemDescriptor&#10;    ): IntentionPreviewInfo {&#10;        applyFix(project, previewDescriptor)&#10;        return IntentionPreviewInfo.DIFF&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun applyFix(project: Project, descriptor: ProblemDescriptor) {&#10;        // 实际修改逻辑&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyQuickFix : LocalQuickFix {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getFamilyName(): String = \"我的修复\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun generatePreview(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        project: Project,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        previewDescriptor: ProblemDescriptor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): IntentionPreviewInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        applyFix(project, previewDescriptor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return IntentionPreviewInfo.DIFF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun applyFix(project: Project, descriptor: ProblemDescriptor) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 实际修改逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"intention-action-与对比\">Intention Action 与对比</h2><p>除了 Inspection + QuickFix，IntelliJ 还有 <strong>Intention Action</strong> 机制。两者的关键区别：Inspection 检测<strong>问题</strong>并提供修复，Intention 提供代码<strong>改进建议</strong>（代码本身没有问题）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ConvertToMultilineStringIntention : PsiElementBaseIntentionAction() {&#10;&#10;    override fun getFamilyName(): String = &quot;转换为多行字符串&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun getText(): String = &quot;将字符串拼接转换为文本块&quot;&#10;&#10;    override fun isAvailable(&#10;        project: Project,&#10;        editor: Editor?,&#10;        element: PsiElement&#10;    ): Boolean {&#10;        val expression = PsiTreeUtil.getParentOfType(&#10;            element, PsiPolyadicExpression::class.java&#10;        ) ?: return false&#10;        return expression.operationTokenType == JavaTokenType.PLUS &amp;&amp;&#10;               expression.operands.all { it is PsiLiteralExpression }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun invoke(project: Project, editor: Editor?, element: PsiElement) {&#10;        val expression = PsiTreeUtil.getParentOfType(&#10;            element, PsiPolyadicExpression::class.java&#10;        ) ?: return&#10;        val parts = expression.operands&#10;            .filterIsInstance&lt;PsiLiteralExpression&gt;()&#10;            .mapNotNull { it.value as? String }&#10;&#10;        val textBlock = &quot;\\&quot;\\&quot;\\&quot;\\n${parts.joinToString(&quot;\\n&quot;)}\\&quot;\\&quot;\\&quot;&quot;&#10;        val factory = JavaPsiFacade.getElementFactory(project)&#10;        val newExpression = factory.createExpressionFromText(textBlock, expression)&#10;&#10;        WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {&#10;            expression.replace(newExpression)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ConvertToMultilineStringIntention : PsiElementBaseIntentionAction() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getFamilyName(): String = \"转换为多行字符串\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getText(): String = \"将字符串拼接转换为文本块\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun isAvailable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        project: Project,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        editor: Editor?,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        element: PsiElement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val expression = PsiTreeUtil.getParentOfType(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            element, PsiPolyadicExpression::class.java</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) ?: return false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return expression.operationTokenType == JavaTokenType.PLUS &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               expression.operands.all { it is PsiLiteralExpression }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun invoke(project: Project, editor: Editor?, element: PsiElement) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val expression = PsiTreeUtil.getParentOfType(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            element, PsiPolyadicExpression::class.java</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val parts = expression.operands</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .filterIsInstance&#x3C;PsiLiteralExpression>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .mapNotNull { it.value as? String }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val textBlock = \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n${parts.joinToString(\"\\n\")}\\\"\\\"\\\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val factory = JavaPsiFacade.getElementFactory(project)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val newExpression = factory.createExpressionFromText(textBlock, expression)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WriteCommandAction.runWriteCommandAction(project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            expression.replace(newExpression)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Inspection + QuickFix</th>\n<th>Intention Action</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发方式</td>\n<td>自动检测问题</td>\n<td>用户主动调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显示方式</td>\n<td>波浪线 + 灯泡</td>\n<td>灯泡（无波浪线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义含义</td>\n<td>代码有问题需要修复</td>\n<td>代码可以改进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册方式</td>\n<td><code>&lt;localInspection&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>&lt;intentionAction&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户可关闭</td>\n<td>可在设置中禁用</td>\n<td>可在设置中禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>空 catch 块、未使用变量</td>\n<td>类型转换、语法糖应用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测试-inspection-与-quickfix\">测试 Inspection 与 QuickFix</h2><p>IntelliJ Platform 提供了完整的测试框架来验证 Inspection 和 QuickFix 的正确性。测试通过对比 <strong>测试数据文件</strong> 中标记的期望问题位置来验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class EmptyCatchBlockInspectionTest : LightJavaCodeInsightFixtureTestCase() {&#10;&#10;    override fun getTestDataPath(): String = &quot;src/test/testData/inspections&quot;&#10;&#10;    fun testEmptyCatchBlock() {&#10;        myFixture.enableInspections(EmptyCatchBlockInspection::class.java)&#10;        myFixture.configureByFile(&quot;EmptyCatchBlock.java&quot;)&#10;        myFixture.checkHighlighting(true, false, true)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun testQuickFix() {&#10;        myFixture.enableInspections(EmptyCatchBlockInspection::class.java)&#10;        myFixture.configureByFile(&quot;EmptyCatchBlockBefore.java&quot;)&#10;        val intention = myFixture.findSingleIntention(&quot;添加日志记录&quot;)&#10;        myFixture.launchAction(intention)&#10;        myFixture.checkResultByFile(&quot;EmptyCatchBlockAfter.java&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun testNoFalsePositive() {&#10;        myFixture.enableInspections(EmptyCatchBlockInspection::class.java)&#10;        myFixture.configureByFile(&quot;NonEmptyCatchBlock.java&quot;)&#10;        myFixture.checkHighlighting(true, false, true)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class EmptyCatchBlockInspectionTest : LightJavaCodeInsightFixtureTestCase() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun getTestDataPath(): String = \"src/test/testData/inspections\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun testEmptyCatchBlock() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.enableInspections(EmptyCatchBlockInspection::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.configureByFile(\"EmptyCatchBlock.java\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.checkHighlighting(true, false, true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun testQuickFix() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.enableInspections(EmptyCatchBlockInspection::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.configureByFile(\"EmptyCatchBlockBefore.java\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val intention = myFixture.findSingleIntention(\"添加日志记录\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.launchAction(intention)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.checkResultByFile(\"EmptyCatchBlockAfter.java\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun testNoFalsePositive() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.enableInspections(EmptyCatchBlockInspection::class.java)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.configureByFile(\"NonEmptyCatchBlock.java\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        myFixture.checkHighlighting(true, false, true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>测试数据文件使用特殊的 XML 标记来标注期望的问题位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// EmptyCatchBlock.java&#10;public class Example {&#10;    public void method() {&#10;        try {&#10;            riskyOperation();&#10;        } &lt;warning descr=&quot;空的 catch 块会吞掉异常，可能导致难以排查的问题&quot;&gt;catch&lt;/warning&gt; (Exception e) {&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// EmptyCatchBlock.java</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Example</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            riskyOperation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">warning descr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"空的 catch 块会吞掉异常，可能导致难以排查的问题\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/warning> (Exception </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[编写测试数据文件] --&gt; B[标记期望高亮]&#10;    B --&gt; C[enableInspections]&#10;    C --&gt; D[configureByFile]&#10;    D --&gt; E[checkHighlighting]&#10;    E --&gt; F{匹配?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[测试通过]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[测试失败 + 差异报告]&#10;&#10;    I[QuickFix 测试] --&gt; J[Before 文件]&#10;    J --&gt; K[findSingleIntention]&#10;    K --&gt; L[launchAction]&#10;    L --&gt; M[checkResultByFile]&#10;    M --&gt; N[对比 After 文件]\">flowchart LR\n    A[编写测试数据文件] --&gt; B[标记期望高亮]\n    B --&gt; C[enableInspections]\n    C --&gt; D[configureByFile]\n    D --&gt; E[checkHighlighting]\n    E --&gt; F{匹配?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[测试通过]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[测试失败 + 差异报告]\n\n    I[QuickFix 测试] --&gt; J[Before 文件]\n    J --&gt; K[findSingleIntention]\n    K --&gt; L[launchAction]\n    L --&gt; M[checkResultByFile]\n    M --&gt; N[对比 After 文件]</pre><p><code>LightJavaCodeInsightFixtureTestCase</code> 提供了轻量级的测试环境，不需要启动完整的 IDE 实例。对于涉及跨文件分析的 Global Inspection 测试，需要使用 <code>JavaCodeInsightFixtureTestCase</code> 并配置多文件测试数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((检查与快速修复))&#10;    Inspection 类型&#10;      LocalInspectionTool&#10;      GlobalInspectionTool&#10;      ExternalAnnotator&#10;    QuickFix&#10;      LocalQuickFix&#10;      IntentionAction&#10;      预览模式&#10;      幂等安全&#10;    问题注册&#10;      ProblemsHolder&#10;      ProblemHighlightType&#10;      groupPath 分类&#10;    开发流程&#10;      buildVisitor&#10;      registerProblem&#10;      applyFix&#10;    测试验证&#10;      测试数据标记&#10;      checkHighlighting&#10;      Before/After 对比\">mindmap\n  root((检查与快速修复))\n    Inspection 类型\n      LocalInspectionTool\n      GlobalInspectionTool\n      ExternalAnnotator\n    QuickFix\n      LocalQuickFix\n      IntentionAction\n      预览模式\n      幂等安全\n    问题注册\n      ProblemsHolder\n      ProblemHighlightType\n      groupPath 分类\n    开发流程\n      buildVisitor\n      registerProblem\n      applyFix\n    测试验证\n      测试数据标记\n      checkHighlighting\n      Before/After 对比</pre><ul>\n<li>Inspection 分为 Local（实时单文件）、Global（批量跨文件）和 External Annotator（外部工具集成）三种类型</li>\n<li><code>LocalInspectionTool</code> 通过 Visitor 模式遍历 PSI 树，使用 <code>ProblemsHolder</code> 注册发现的问题</li>\n<li>QuickFix 在 <code>applyFix()</code> 中修改 PSI 树，支持多修复方案选择和预览模式</li>\n<li>Intention Action 与 QuickFix 的区别：前者提供改进建议，后者修复实际问题</li>\n<li>测试框架基于测试数据文件的标记对比机制，支持高亮验证和 Before/After 修复验证</li>\n<li>Inspection 的 <code>groupPath</code> 和 <code>level</code> 配置影响用户体验，应合理规划分类和默认严重级别</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"检查与快速修复","id":"检查与快速修复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LocalInspectionTool 实现","id":"localinspectiontool-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"QuickFix 开发模式","id":"quickfix-开发模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Intention Action 与对比","id":"intention-action-与对比"},{"level":2,"text":"测试 Inspection 与 QuickFix","id":"测试-inspection-与-quickfix"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PSI 与 AST 操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin/psi-and-ast"},"next":{"title":"插件打包与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/ide-extension-development/jetbrains-plugin/plugin-distribution"}}